{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2019-12-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER WORKS COMPANY, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON MARCH 4, 2020', 'text': 'AMERICAN WATER WORKS COMPANY, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 50 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON MARCH 4, 2020, TO ALL SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF FEBRUARY 7, 2020.'}